Ques17:
Draw a flowchart showing how an ESP32 performs an OTA (Over-the-Air) firmware update, including error handling if the update fails. 
Ans – 
                                                                       Start
                                                                          ↓
                                                        Check for New Firmware
                                                                           ↓
                                                            Is Update Available?
                                                   ┌───────┴────────┐
                                                  No                                             Yes
                                                   ↓                                                ↓
                                           Run Current                         Download Update
                                            Firmware                                         ↓
                                                                                                 Verify File
                                                                                                       ↓
                                                                                     Installation Successful?
                                                                             ┌────────┴────────┐
                                                                            Yes                                               No
                                                                             ↓                                                  ↓
                                                                   Restart Device                        Keep Old Firmware
                                                                             ↓                                                  ↓
                                                                           End                                              End
This process ensures that if the update fails, the ESP32 continues running the old firmware safely. 
